{"id":"cf5d1ce9-369c-55de-923f-8da2ce92c74d","title":"网页版 ChatGPT（邀请制）","icon":"💬","cover":"none","parentId":"79fa3b16-d74e-58cd-81a0-2c01bd8a9499","favorite":false,"archived":false,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T20:03:21.422Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-21T17:41:46.101Z","content":{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"root","kind":"page","name":"网页版 ChatGPT（邀请制）","widthMode":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-hero","version":"1.0.0","props":{"eyebrow":"ChatGPT · Web · MCP · 邀请制","title":"在网页版 ChatGPT 使用 ShowAI","lead":"连接官方 MCP 后，可以在 ChatGPT 对话里查找项目、制作交互页面、保存到 ShowAI Cloud，并继续修改。每个人添加自己的连接，登录自己的 ShowAI 账号。","facts":[{"label":"接入方式","value":"自定义 MCP 服务器"},{"label":"使用位置","value":"chatgpt.com 网页对话"},{"label":"私有项目","value":"ShowAI 账号 + OAuth"},{"label":"状态","value":"邀请制"}],"actions":[{"label":"打开 ChatGPT 插件","href":"https://chatgpt.com/plugins","primary":true},{"label":"账号与同步说明","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/cloud"}],"art":"agent"},"integrity":"sha256-7c2bbe84b00357b5e96de32cad51cf6537d38c28d4eadca35435483ba772646e"},"id":"node-b7460b99"}},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"🎟️","tone":"sand","id":"node-b6460a06"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"邀请制。","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 网页版 ChatGPT 通过 ShowAI Cloud 账号连接，目前注册需要运营者提供的注册密钥，或共享项目的邀请。没有时，可以在 "},{"type":"text","text":"Claude Code 或 Codex","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-hosts"}}]},{"type":"text","text":" 中使用 ShowAI，或使用 "},{"type":"text","text":"内置 Agent","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/built-in-agent"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"，见 "},{"type":"text","text":"快速上手","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/quick-start"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-7de40061"}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"准备一个可以添加自定义 MCP 的 ChatGPT 账号。工作区权限和安全限制会影响入口是否可用；如果看不到「Add custom MCP server」，先检查账号功能及管理员设置。完成 ShowAI 账号开通后，日常网页使用无需运行本机 ShowAI、安装 ZIP 或另装 Skills。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b5460873"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-b44606e0"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"1. 开通 ShowAI Cloud 账号"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"已有 ShowAI Cloud 账号可以直接进入第 2 步。ChatGPT 账号与 ShowAI 账号各自独立；GitHub 或 Google 登录也需要先关联到 ShowAI 账号。官方 Cloud 当前是受控注册，添加 MCP 本身不会创建 ShowAI 账号。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-bb4611e5"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"取得邀请或注册密钥","body":"向共享项目的管理员索取邀请链接，或向 ShowAI Cloud 维护者索取注册密钥。尚未拿到其中一种时，可以先使用公开组件、模板和临时渲染；保存私有项目需要先开通账号。"},{"title":"通过工作台完成首次注册","body":"首次开通目前使用 ShowAI 工作台（桌面 App 或本地浏览器版）。有注册密钥：在「设置 → 账号与同步 → 服务器账号 → 添加服务器账号」填入下方 Cloud 地址，选「注册新账号」，填写账号、至少 12 位密码及注册密钥。有邀请：在「项目同步 → 加入共享项目」粘贴邀请链接，在邀请卡片中注册并确认加入；这种方式不需要注册密钥。","code":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/cloud","lang":"text"},{"title":"保留登录方式","body":"记住刚注册的账号和密码，稍后可直接在 MCP 授权页登录。想用 GitHub 或 Google，在工作台的账号卡片打开「账号与设备」，先绑定对应账号。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-ba461052"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"还没有工作台？安装见 "},{"type":"text","text":"安装与运行","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/install"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。需要账号开通，可以在 "},{"type":"text","text":"GitHub Issues","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://github.com/Renaissance-Mind/ShowAI/issues"}}]},{"type":"text","text":" 联系维护者。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b9460ebf"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-b8460d2c"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"2. 在 ChatGPT 添加 MCP"}]},{"type":"orderedList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"打开 chatgpt.com/plugins（下方有链接），点击加号，选择「Add custom MCP server / 添加自定义 MCP 服务器」。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-2f0e2509"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4f79e4be"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"按下表填写连接配置。选择服务器 URL 连接；不需要本地启动命令或隧道。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-aad3aede"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5079e651"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"阅读提示后确认继续，点击「Create as a plugin」，再安装刚创建的 ShowAI。连接或首次访问项目时，按第 3 步完成授权。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d9fce33f"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4d79e198"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-bf461831"}},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"配置项"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-eccb2881"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c7e6d426"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"填写内容"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-47a2fd56"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c8e6d5b9"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d4f18f69"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"名称"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-aef4b41e"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-edad9991"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ShowAI"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-332f2a49"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ecad97fe"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d3f18dd6"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Server URL"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-bba3d03b"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f2d65bdc"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"https://agent.showai.renaissancemind.ai/mcp"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-95dd0ad0"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f3d65d6f"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d2f18c43"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"认证方式"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-670e6f98"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-175fecc7"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"OAuth or no authentication（OAuth 或无认证）"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-eb9897a3"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-165feb34"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d1f18ab0"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"OAuth 客户端注册"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-758d3aed"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1395a6fa"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"如出现选项，选择 Dynamic Client Registration（DCR）"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5103aa02"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1495a88d"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d8f195b5"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Client ID / Client Secret"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fd0342a"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-98bd9fc5"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"留空，由 DCR 自动注册；无需申请 OpenAI API Key"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-145992b5"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-97bd9e32"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d7f19422"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-be46169e"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"text","id":"node-26421302"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"https://agent.showai.renaissancemind.ai/mcp"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"打开 ChatGPT 插件页面","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://chatgpt.com/plugins"}}]}],"attrs":{"id":"node-27421495"}},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"🔌","tone":"blue","id":"node-24420fdc"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"MCP 地址以 /mcp 结尾；账号注册和工作台同步地址以 /cloud 结尾。ChatGPT 的 Server URL 要填前者。公开工具允许匿名调用；读写个人项目时会转入 OAuth 登录。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-bc98a43b"}}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-2542116f"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"3. 登录并选择授权范围"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"登录你自己的 ShowAI 账号","body":"在「连接 ShowAI」页确认服务器为官方 Cloud，输入已有账号和密码；也可以选择已绑定的 GitHub 或 Google 登录。这里使用的是 ShowAI 登录方式，不是 ChatGPT 的密码。"},{"title":"第三方登录：填写完成码","body":"点击「打开登录页面」，在新标签页完成 GitHub 或 Google 登录。最后页面显示 8 位完成码（形如 XXXX-XXXX）；回到最初的「连接 ShowAI」标签页，填入「完成码」并点「继续」。完成码只填在该授权页，不要发到聊天中。账号密码登录可跳过这一步。"},{"title":"确认项目范围与操作权限","body":"只处理一个已有项目，可以选择「仅授权一个项目」。需要新建项目，选择「授权这个账号当前及今后有权限的所有项目」，并核对授权页显示「包含新建项目」及可读取、编辑。确认账号和权限后点「确认授权」，返回 ChatGPT。账号范围授权仍受各项目成员权限限制；查看者不能编辑。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-22420cb6"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"只授权一个项目后，其他项目及新项目不会自动进入范围。需要扩大范围时，在 ChatGPT 中重新连接并授权。连接到期、被撤销或权限变化时也按提示重新登录。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-23420e49"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-20420990"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"4. 做出并保存第一份页面"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"新开一个普通 ChatGPT 网页对话，输入 @ 并选择你刚安装的 ShowAI。后续继续使用同一个连接；若有多个同名插件，核对它的 MCP 地址。按顺序发送下面三条请求。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-21420b23"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-steps","version":"1.0.0","props":{"steps":[{"title":"检查连接与项目","body":"先确认登录身份、授权范围及可见项目。新账号的项目列表可以为空。\n\n用 ShowAI 检查当前连接，并列出我有权限的项目。","lang":"text"},{"title":"创建、保存并展示","body":"需要账号范围和新建权限。按 ChatGPT 提示核对写入操作；完成后确认返回项目、页面和同步状态。\n\n用 ShowAI 新建项目「我的交互笔记」，做一页机会成本讲解，加入可以调整选项的互动示例。保存到该项目，确认同步状态，再在对话中展示。","lang":"text"},{"title":"续改已有页面","body":"指明刚才的项目和页面，让 Agent 读取后修改；新对话也可以按项目名和页面名查找。\n\n用 ShowAI 打开「我的交互笔记」中的机会成本页面，增加一个日常生活例子，保留已有互动，保存并展示更新。","lang":"text"}]},"integrity":"sha256-660edad476b2fda02cf5d65a2e90470d95d7c2335d975efaa102a0360d58f20a"},"id":"node-2e421f9a"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"创作流程、组件说明和模板指南由 MCP 从共用 Skill 源文件按需提供。ChatGPT 不需要本机 Skill 安装。页面展示与保存、同步分别确认：看到预览不等于已经同步成功。仅在电脑上保存的项目，要先用工作台同步到同一个 Cloud 账号，网页端才能找到。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-2f42212d"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-a03f0179"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"5. 后续怎样更新"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"更新内容"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9746b359"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-8ab1a9ee"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你需要做什么"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-130c3d2e"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-8bb1ab81"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1c4e9a41"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"创作指南、模板说明或服务端实现"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1a9f3db6"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-eec2019"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"由 ShowAI 维护者部署。后续请求使用已部署版本；建议新开对话读取最新指南，无需下载 ZIP。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-bfc768e1"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-dec1e86"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1b4e98ae"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"工具名称、说明、参数、权限声明或预览资源"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-dc296593"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-34b2e584"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"打开 ChatGPT 插件 → 你的 ShowAI 连接 → Refresh / 刷新工具。核对工具列表后，新开对话并重新选择 @ShowAI。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-57016cc8"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-35b2e717"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1a4e971b"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"登录失效或需要更大授权范围"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-757edc30"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b9dade4f"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"按提示重新连接、登录并确认授权范围；刷新工具不会自动扩大项目权限。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9a086d1b"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b8dadcbc"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-194e9588"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9f3effe6"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"把本页和官方 MCP 地址发给其他人即可；每个人用自己的 ChatGPT 添加连接，再用自己的 ShowAI 账号授权。你的私人连接和授权不会随链接共享给别人。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-9e3efe53"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-9d3efcc0"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"遇到问题"}]},{"type":"toggle","attrs":{"title":"OAuth 设置发现失败，或 DCR 显示不可用","open":false,"id":"node-a43f07c5"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"先核对 Server URL 完整包含 /mcp，在「高级 OAuth 设置」点击「重试元数据发现」。如果仍失败，可以按下表手动填写 OAuth 端点，再将「注册方法」设为「动态客户端注册（DCR）」。客户端 ID 和密钥留空，OIDC 保持关闭。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4373dc2a"}},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"高级 OAuth 字段"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4750fda"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4526b495"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"填写内容"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-899d08a5"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4426b302"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c2418e12"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"授权网址"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ec667d9d"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-bf5f580a"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"https://agent.showai.renaissancemind.ai/oauth/authorize"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-473e5272"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c05f599d"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c3418fa5"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Token URL"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-49623b74"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ee888c6b"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"https://agent.showai.renaissancemind.ai/oauth/token"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4f28ce7f"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ed888ad8"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c0418aec"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"注册地址"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-13d490f7"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-49606140"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"https://agent.showai.renaissancemind.ai/oauth/register"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6eac65cc"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4a6062d3"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c1418c7f"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"授权服务器基础地址"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-17eb314e"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-19781421"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"https://agent.showai.renaissancemind.ai"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1d621279"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1878128e"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-be4187c6"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"资源"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e1700431"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-744fe8f6"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"https://agent.showai.renaissancemind.ai/mcp"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-bce67346"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-754fea89"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-bf418959"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4473ddbd"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"默认请求的权限范围可按需要填写 projects.read、projects.write、projects.create，每行一个；只读使用可仅保留 projects.read。最终权限以授权页和项目角色为准。若创建或登录仍失败，保留错误信息向维护者反馈。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-4173d904"}}]},{"type":"toggle","attrs":{"title":"没有账号，或者 GitHub / Google 登录失败","open":false,"id":"node-a33f0632"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"先按第 1 步取得邀请或注册密钥并开通 Cloud 账号。第三方身份尚未绑定时，用账号密码登录；以后再到工作台绑定。检查完成码是否填回最初发起登录的标签页，失效时重新发起登录。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-47fd3ab5"}}]},{"type":"toggle","attrs":{"title":"找不到项目，或不能新建项目","open":false,"id":"node-a23f049f"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"检查是否使用正确的 Cloud 账号、项目是否已同步、当前是否只授权了一个项目。新建项目需要账号范围与新建权限；在授权页没有看到「包含新建项目」时，触发新建请求后按提示重新授权。若工具未出现，刷新工具并新开对话，核对所选连接地址。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-cd74e560"}}]},{"type":"toggle","attrs":{"title":"提示「未能显示 ShowAI」","open":false,"id":"node-a13f030c"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可先点击预览卡片的 Retry / 重试。仍失败时，让 ChatGPT 报告页面保存和同步状态，并提供完整 HTML 交付物（如可用）。预览失败与内容保存失败需要分别判断；请保留错误信息以便反馈。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-729d108b"}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"界面入口可能随 ChatGPT 更新而变化；以账号当前显示为准。官方操作说明："}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a83f0e11"}},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","conten